{"actor": "unknown-agent", "data": {"documentation_gaps": {}, "duration_s": 1996.9, "landed_paths": 0, "missing_artifacts": 0, "next": "Run release check to verify preflight/ is properly classified in RELEASE-MANIFEST.md, then consider whether to publish to PyPI.", "outcome": "worked", "push_requested": false, "summary": "Packaged preflight tool for release consideration. Copied the preflight package from EXPERIMENTS/124-eval-harness-preflight/preflight/ to preflight/ at root level with all 4 modules (concordance, alternate_form, control_arm, report), 4 built-in adapters (JSONL, CSV, YAML, XML), test suite (16 tests, all passing), README with origin-meta, LICENSE, and pyproject.toml. The tool validates LLM evaluation harnesses by checking C1 concordance (key-output identifier matching), C2 alternate-form false-positive rate (per arm with Wilson intervals), and C3 control arm validity (catches contaminated negative arms). It withholds the rate (exit 3) when any check fails. This tool caught three silent failures in this repository's own harnesses (F118, F121, F122).", "unlogged_changes": 84}, "host": "instance-20260717-0947", "kind": "session_end", "schema": "origin.session.event/1", "seq": 87, "session": "2026-10-13-028-package-preflight-tool-for-release-consi", "ts": "2026-10-13T14:15:16+00:00"}
